OL,3,GNEWSA'Sister's incurable cancer
OL,4,Ainspired life change '
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen years ago, Mel de Lange was a busy
OL,7,Fworking mum, running a market
OL,8,Fintelligence agency while also bringing
OL,9,Fup her two children. Then, in 2016,
OL,10,Fcame the devastating news that her
OL,11,Folder sister Becca's breast cancer had
OL,12,Fnot only returned but was incurable.
OL,14,FIt proved to be life-changing for both
OL,15,Fsiblings, motivating Mel to start a
OL,16,Fjourney in health research.
OL,18,FNow, seven years after her sister's
OL,19,Fdeath, Mel is a PhD graduate and
OL,20,Fworking to help doctors identify other
OL,21,Fpatients who might have cancer.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
